<title>NORWAY: ALPINE SKIING-STROBL WINS MEN'S SUPER-G.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-STROBL WINS MEN'S SUPER-G.</headline>
<dateline>KVITFJELL, Norway 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's Josef Strobl won a men's World Cup super-G on Sunday in one minute 24.95 seconds, according to unofficial results.</p>
<p>Andreas Schifferer of Austria was second in 1:25.63 and Norway's Lasse Kjus third in 1:25.87.</p>
